@startuml application-status
' NON-COMPLIANT on purpose. Deliberate defects:
'   - nothing says what moves an application to Approved (STA003)
'   - "Withdrawn" has no way in: no transition reaches it (STA002, major)
'   - the footer names no owner (GEN006)
'   - it cites CRD-106, which is not in requirements.txt (trace: unknown reference)
title Application status
footer CRD-102 CRD-104 CRD-106

[*] --> Submitted
Submitted --> Incomplete : documentsMissing
Incomplete --> Submitted : documentsReceived
Submitted --> Scored : scoreComputed
Scored --> Approved
Scored --> Rejected : reject [score insufficient]
Withdrawn --> Closed : withdrawalConfirmed
Approved --> Closed : customerInformed
Rejected --> Closed : customerInformed
Closed --> [*]
@enduml
